  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1204.65 VOC subcategory",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1204.65 \"VOC subcategory\" means any process, device, or operation subordinate to one of the categories listed in Env-A 1201.03(a)(1) through (21), above, for which a VOC RACT standard has been prescribed in the applicable category.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
